OL,3,GNEWSACare home resident awarded
OL,4,APoland's Siberian Exiles Star for WW2
OL,5,Ahardships
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 93-year-old Polish woman who lives in
OL,8,Fthe Highlands has been recognised with
OL,9,Fan award from her homeland for the
OL,10,Fhardships she suffered as a child
OL,11,Fduring World War Two.
OL,13,FHelena Rosol was six years old when the
OL,14,FSoviet Union (USSR) invaded Poland.
OL,16,FIn February 1940, Helena and her family
OL,17,Fwere among hundreds of thousands of
OL,18,FPoles removed from their homes and sent
OL,19,Fto forced labour camps in the Russian
OL,20,Fregion of Siberia, where they endured
OL,21,Fmalnutrition and disease.
